{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03986","headline":"上元夜效小庾体 · 韩仲宣","name":"上元夜效小庾体","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"他乡月夜人，相伴看灯轮。\n光随九华出，影共百枝新。\n歌钟盛北里，车马沸南邻。\n今宵何处好？惟有洛城春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩仲宣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03986.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03986","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}